@startuml
robust "Web Browser" as WB
concise "Web User" as WU
clock "Clock" as CLK with period 50
binary "Enabled" as EN

@0
WU is Idle
WB is Idle
EN is low

@100
WU is Waiting
WB is Processing
EN is high
WU -> WB : URL

@300
WB is Waiting

@450
WU is Idle
WB is Idle
EN is low

WB@300 <-> @450 : {150 ms}
highlight 300 to 450 #e7f5ff : waiting
@enduml
